 compiler/procinfo.pas         |   5 ++
 compiler/psub.pas             |  60 ++++++++++++++
 tests/test/opt/tcoldraise1.pp | 149 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 314 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/test/opt/tcoldraise1.pp

